    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Tiers API enables clients to access and view the various loyalty points tiers associated with a hotel loyalty program. This API provides detailed information about each tier, including the rewards and benefits tied to them, facilitating informed decision-making for loyalty program participants. Typical consumers of this API include mobile app developers, hotel management systems, and marketing teams looking to enhance customer engagement through targeted loyalty initiatives. With this endpoint, users can easily retrieve comprehensive data about loyalty tiers to better understand customer rewards options.",
